# Dependencies of MediaPipe that the AI Worker's runtime leaves out, for
# `uv pip compile --excludes` and `uv pip install --excludes`
# (scripts/build-ai-runtime.sh). `pip check` reports them as missing, and the
# build accepts exactly these reports.
#
# The GUI build of OpenCV needs X libraries; requirements.in names the headless
# build, which provides the same module.
opencv-contrib-python
# Serves only MediaPipe's audio tasks (and brings cffi and pycparser).
sounddevice
